  <event id="111">
      <start>15:00</start>
      <duration>01:00</duration>
      <room>AW1.126</room>
      <slug></slug>
      <title>Emdebian Update: Rootfs, GPE and tdebs</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Embedded</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk covers the current status of the &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.emdebian.org/&#34;&gt;Embedded Debian project&lt;/a&gt;, preparation of a cross built Debian root filesystem for ARM with support for customisation, improved translation support in &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.emdebian.org/&#34;&gt;Emdebian&lt;/a&gt; and the next steps to making Debian available to embedded devices.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Also includes the status of GPE packages in Debian and Emdebian and a description of the Emdebian implementation of Tdebs - translation packages with secondary repository and cache support.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="1111">Neil Williams</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>